        "Describe motion in plain terms: slow, steady, soft",
        "Give speeds and sizes exactly",
        "Keep captions below fifteen words"
      ],
      "donts": [
        "Do not use 'blazing' or 'lightning'",
        "Do not describe a spinner as 'delightful'",
        "Do not shout"
      ]
    },
